        "rationale": "Rich, legible, fear and seize both on dated evidence, a deep behavioural substrate to synthesise, quarterly cadence. Carries the versioned-enactment claim and the concluding cross-domain comparison \u2014 deliberately last, because it is the most seductive claim and the least defensible standing alone.",
