        "rationale": "Nearly free, and the most honest thing in the demo: a genuine unresolved forecast, emitted, pinned, signed, where we do not know the answer either. It cannot be scored yet, and saying so on screen is the strongest demonstration of the falsifiability claim \u2014 a dated prediction someone can come back and check beats any retrospective.",
